# Git Commits

Use Conventional Commits: `<type>(<scope>): <subject>`

Allowed types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore

- Subject: imperative, lowercase, header <= 72 chars
- Squash-merge PRs into main
- PR titles must follow Conventional Commits (enforced in CI)
- Local: Husky commit-msg runs commitlint
- CI: semantic PR title validation in .github/workflows/semantic-pull-request.yml
